OL,3,GNEWSAPeople tried to save girl and aunt
OL,4,Afrom house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of the public tried to save a
OL,7,Fseven-year-old and her aunt who were
OL,8,Fkilled in a house fire, an inquest
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FNatalie McDonald, 34, died alongside
OL,12,Fher niece Valentina Foster in the blaze
OL,13,Fat Birchington Avenue, Grangetown, near
OL,14,FMiddlesbrough, in the early hours of 26
OL,15,FAugust.
OL,17,FTeesside coroner Paul Appleton held
OL,18,Fbrief, separate, inquest openings into
OL,19,Ftheir deaths and suspended further
OL,20,Fhearings as criminal proceedings have
OL,21,Fbegun.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
